# Welcome!

#### This professional learning module prepares you to teach **AI Generated Design**—a unit where students design and build web apps by combining empathy-driven design thinking with AI-assisted creation.


#### **AI Generated Design** is the first unit in the six unit AI Foundations Semester 2 course.

#### *Note: AI Foundations Semester 2 is designed to be taught sequentially*.
___

<div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; width: 95%; margin: 20pt auto; padding: 0 5px;">
  <img src="https://images.code.org/36211eedb3698751fa5523b4dde93351-image-1760467094025.png" style="border-radius: 5pt; width: 32%;">
  <img src="https://images.code.org/7f813b0aec7d472e470f94eb91471aa1-image-1760466945803.png" style="border-radius: 5pt; width: 32%;">
  <img src="https://images.code.org/ddb463a06ccc88f5d7390a1f841a0f31-image-1760467013014.png" style="border-radius: 5pt; width: 32%;">
</div>

___


#### **By the end of this professional learning module, you will be able to:**

* #### Prepare to teach what a web app is and explain how it serves as the foundation for AI-assisted projects.

* #### Guide students through human-centered design practices, including developing user personas, defining user problems, and establishing a brand identity.

* #### Practice foundational web development skills using AI to build **HTML** files for structure and **CSS** files for styling.


* #### Support students in visual planning, preparing to introduce sitemaps and wireframes that emphasize accessibility and responsive design.

---

